            "review_title": "Review at V-senses Cafe - Vietnamese Heritage House",
            "review_text": "Curiosity27204630673\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat cafe\nOct 2025 • Friends\nStaying in Furama villa, my friends and I just found out this hidden gem. We ordered earl grey milktea and pink guava tea, both are delicious. Especially Tram was very helpful to recommend us the drinks. Will definitely come back.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 11, 2025\nOnAir13424283813\nDear valued guest, \nThanks for the great review and hope to see you again soon\nTeam V-Sense\nWritten February 2, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
